# Placeholder for web-llm .patch files
#
# Usage:
#   - Create patches with: cd 3rd_party/web-llm && git format-patch -1 <commit>
#   - Or manually: git diff > ../../patches/web-llm/0001-my-change.patch
#   - The build script (scripts/build-webllm.sh) can apply them when APPLY_PATCHES=1
#
# Keep patches small, well-documented, and rebased against upstream tags when possible.
# Prefer landing changes in the ford442/web-llm fork when they are substantial.
